Question 2

Concept: Extracting printable text characters out of a compiled binary file.
Problem: You are given an executable file that outputs an error when executed, but contains the flag embedded within its code layers.
use this in terminal
strings strings_file | grep "picoCTF"
Explanation:
The strings utility scans static binaries and returns any readable text it finds. 
Piping that output into grep screens out the garbage code and returns the precise flag line.

